Traew
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 27 DEAL {STOLUF, XIOC, COLUMN}
XIOC 2 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
XIOC 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
XIOC 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
XIOC 1 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
XIOC 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
XIOC 10 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
XIOC 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
XIOC 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
XIOC 5 FACE_LAST
XIOC 2 FACE_LAST

STOLUF 5 FACE_ALL
STOLUF 7 FACE_ALL
STOLUF 6 FACE_ALL
STOLUF 5 FACE_ALL
STOLUF 3 FACE_ALL
STOLUF 0 FACE_ALL
STOLUF 2 FACE_ALL

COLUMN 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE XIOC {COLUMN, XIOC, STOLUF}
DESTSRC Rank equal
DRAW
PILE ANY DRAW Size > 0
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL XIOC Empty
    PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
